ime, do not always look at a skill cooldown number zero and miss the wonderful battle, just focus on the opponent, put your eyes on the battle feast.<br><br><br><strong>Beast talent</strong><br>Reaching the level of the divine Beast and above will unlock talents and greatly enhance the power of the alien, such as Suzaku's Nirvana regeneration: regeneration after death by consuming meripoints. Greatly increased survivability. Each beast has a different talent, please experience.<br><br><br><strong>Free upbringing</strong><br>After swallowing the beast will get attribute points, you can assign attribute points to develop different abilities of the beast. For example, the white tiger thunder injury skills are more, you can enhance the skill damage by adding the &quot;thunder&quot; attribute, or add the &quot;Xuan&quot; attribute to strengthen the physical attack, different choices will have different experiences.<br><br><br>More gameplay updates continue, stay tuned...",
